[h1]More Tenets Slots (XA) — CK3 1.20.0.3[/h1]
Expand your rite's core tenet slots to 100, with scrollable grids in the new rite creation and faith interfaces.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Up to 100 core tenet slots for rites, using the game's current tenet definitions.
[*]Scrollable tenet grids in rite creation and both faith detail layouts. The final slot's selector opens normally.
[*]Create and save a rite with two real core tenets and trailing empty slots, or compatible tenets with gaps between occupied slots. Native tenet and doctrine compatibility restrictions still apply.
[*]Culture tradition base limit remains 10000; normal eligibility, costs and cooldowns apply.
[/list]
Native tenet restrictions, conflicts, DLC requirements and costs still apply. A 100-slot limit does not guarantee 100 mutually compatible tenets.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese and Spanish localization files are included. Non-Chinese languages are format-certified; future live validation uses Simplified Chinese.

Version 10 is tested on [b]CK3 1.20.0.3 (Crozier)[/b], including two-tenet creation/save and Simplified Chinese creation with slots 1, 2, 3 and 100 occupied and 96 gaps left empty. Tests cover the recorded installation and DLC combination; they do not cover every combination or 10000 traditions. Migration of CK3 1.19 saves is unverified. The separate POD patches are not covered by this release. Mods replacing the same faith or rite windows may need a compatibility patch.

[h2]中文说明[/h2]
为新版礼仪系统扩展至 [b]100 个核心信条槽位[/b]，创建窗口与信仰详情窗口均可滚动查看。
[list]
[*]使用新版游戏原生信条定义，保留原生费用、互斥、条件及 DLC 限制。
[*]可以只选两个真实信条，尾部其余槽位留空，正常创建、保存及冷重载；简中也已成功创建第 1、2、3、100 槽放入真实信条、中间 96 槽留空的礼仪。仍须满足原生信条与教条的兼容条件。
[*]已修复末端槽位打开选择器时的崩溃，第 100 槽可正常打开。
[*]文化传统基础上限保持 10000，原生费用、条件和冷却仍生效。
[/list]
已补齐游戏支持的九种语言本地化；后续实机只用简体中文，其他语言仅做格式认证。

版本 10 已在 CK3 1.20.0.3 验证代表性关键流程，未穷举全部信条、DLC 组合或 10000 项传统；100 个槽位也不代表有 100 个互不冲突的信条。1.19 旧存档跨版本迁移未验证；本次更新不包含独立 POD 补丁。同样覆盖信仰或礼仪窗口的其他 mod 可能需要兼容补丁。

